<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Abecafe to issue new coffee estimate May 15.</title>
<headline>Brazil Abecafe to issue new coffee estimate May 15.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Coffee Exporters Association (Abecafe) is to publish its second estimate of the 1997/98 coffee crop on May 15, Abecafe said in a statement.</p>
<p>Abecafe first estimated the crop at 23.2 million 60-kg bags on Feb 19 after a survey of 23 of its 45 member firms/ ((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
